sequenceDiagram
    participant Platform as Platform Operator<br/>(RHOAI/ODH)
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant OGXModule as ogx-module<br/>Reconciler
    participant OGXOp as ogx-k8s-operator<br/>Deployment
    participant Webhook as Validating Webhook<br/>9443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Reconciler as OGXServer<br/>Reconciler
    participant Prom as Prometheus
    participant Metrics as Metrics Server<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS

    Note over Platform, OGXModule: Flow 1: OGX Module Component Deployment

    Platform->>K8sAPI: Create OGX CR<br/>(components.platform.opendatahub.io/v1alpha1)<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount
    K8sAPI-->>OGXModule: Watch notification
    OGXModule->>K8sAPI: Render kustomize manifests<br/>(CRDs, Deployments, RBAC, Webhooks)<br/>HTTPS/6443, TLS 1.2+
    OGXModule->>K8sAPI: Deploy ogx-k8s-operator<br/>HTTPS/6443, TLS 1.2+
    K8sAPI-->>OGXOp: Operator Pod started

    Note over Webhook, Reconciler: Flow 2: OGXServer Reconciliation

    participant User as User / Data Scientist
    User->>K8sAPI: Create/Update OGXServer CR<br/>(ogx.io/v1beta1)<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount
    K8sAPI->>Webhook: Admission review (CREATE/UPDATE)<br/>HTTPS/9443, TLS (platform profile)<br/>FailurePolicy: Fail
    Webhook-->>K8sAPI: Admit / Reject
    K8sAPI-->>Reconciler: Watch notification
    Reconciler->>K8sAPI: Create Deployment, Service<br/>HTTPS/6443, TLS 1.2+
    Reconciler->>K8sAPI: Create HPA, PDB<br/>HTTPS/6443, TLS 1.2+
    Reconciler->>K8sAPI: Create NetworkPolicy, Ingress<br/>HTTPS/6443, TLS 1.2+
    Reconciler->>K8sAPI: Create ConfigMap, PVC, Secret refs<br/>HTTPS/6443, TLS 1.2+
    Reconciler->>K8sAPI: Create ServiceMonitor, PrometheusRule<br/>HTTPS/6443, TLS 1.2+
    Reconciler->>K8sAPI: Update OGXServer status<br/>HTTPS/6443, TLS 1.2+

    Note over Prom, Metrics: Flow 3: Metrics Collection

    Prom->>Metrics: GET /metrics<br/>HTTPS/8443, TLS (platform profile)<br/>Auth: TokenReview + SubjectAccessReview
    Metrics-->>Prom: Prometheus metrics
